<title>PHILIPPINES: Dharmala sells stake in Boake unit.</title>
<headline>Dharmala sells stake in Boake unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dharmala Philippines Inc said on Friday it had completed the sale of its stake in Bush Boake Allen Philippines Inc, a joint venture with Bush Boake Allen Inc of the United States, for $7.7 million.</p>
<p>&quot;The sale is part of Dharmala's strategy to raise funds for investments in high growth, high return ventures,&quot; Dharmala chairman and chief executive officer Alan Ortiz said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company did not say who the stake had been sold to.</p>
</text>
